WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.720
Not enough.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.010
Even after consuming all the mysteries of the Demon World...

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:14.290
The hunger in my brain remains unsatiated.

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.540
Up there.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.410
I shall search up there.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.600
For the most complicated...

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.570
The most profound...

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.310
And the most delicious...

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:31.950
The ultimate mystery!

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.570
It's not enough.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.460
Isn’t there any good food left here any more?

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:16.660
Can my hungering stomach never receive satisfaction?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.030
As usual, you can still eat <i>that</i> much, huh?

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.770
Ah, really?

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.340
But my appetite lately has been pretty bad.

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.310
Maybe it’s stress?

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:26.830
What sort of stress?

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:33.160
I can never stay calm, because I always feel like someone is watching me.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.140
Yeah, right.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.380
Hey look, it’s her!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.720
That schoolgirl detective...

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:40.800
Hey, she’s pretty cute!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.280
She sure can eat, huh?

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:42.870
Ehh, really?

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:50.710
Well, it’s nothing surprising, I guess. You've caused quite a storm.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:55.170
Ahh… About that… Actually…

00:02:58.840 --> 00:02:59.650
What’s wrong?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:01.480
N…Nothing!

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.420
Yako! Are you okay?

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.410
Sorry I'm late!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.550
Sensei! We’ve been waiting!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:43.830
The client’s been waiting for a while now.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.000
You dared to make me wait for you...

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.060
Quite bold for a servant.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.630
Um…

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.640
I’m sorry to be bothering you when you’re so busy.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.770
It’s not like that, I’m totally not...

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.680
Ahh… yes.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:03.030
Because of clients everywhere, Sensei is always running about.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:09.010
But, that aside, please lead us to the business that received the threat letter.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.280
Threat letter?

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:11.380
Please, go ahead.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.610
Uhh... All right,

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.210
let us go then.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.640
H-Hey, Neuro!

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:25.270
I didn’t hear anything about this.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.470
A brain more primitive than a worm's has no need to hear about it.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:32.660
Just keep your mouth shut and act the role of the detective.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:35.390
And you mind the house, understand?

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.590
I’m not gonna follow your orders.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.160
I've left your food right there.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.450
Are you even listening to me?

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.030
ISN’T THAT DOG FOOD?!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.220
Shit!

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.710
Nice to meet you, I’m Ishigaki Jun!

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:58.580
Ahh! I’m so honored to be able to work with Sasazuka-senpai so soon after landing this job!

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.120
Amazing ability, coupled with a cool demeanor...

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.290
I’ve always been a fan of yours!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.770
Ah, really.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:06.220
By the way,

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.470
what is this?

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:11.090
Oh, you don’t know? It’s Doshirouto Musume.

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:11.090
<u>Translation note</u>: "Doshirouto Musume" = "Totally Amateur Girls". A jibe at J-pop troupe Morning Musume.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.920
This is an official car. Don’t bring that crap in here.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.510
I know this place!

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.910
This is the Supreme Shirota famed for dishes that bring success, right?

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:30.660
Dishes that bring success.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:35.710
Yeah, I've heard that people who had French cooking here actually experienced miracles!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:41.180
"Bliss will envelop you, and you will gain the strength to win in all contests.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:44.600
Doubts will leave you, and success will knock on your door!"

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:50.690
Just what kind of cooking could it be?

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.870
Even if just a single time, I've wanted to try it so much!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.690
You seem to know a lot about food,

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.790
even though your brain is below a pig's.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.080
Please, detectives, come in.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:04.820
The owner and head chef is already awaiting you.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:07.590
Inspectors!

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.310
You came at a good time.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.030
Inspectors?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.870
Yes... Things being as they are...

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.280
You’re making very sure, I see.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.600
Was it your idea?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.510
No, it was the owner's.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.470
Ah, I see.

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.040
Well then, please come in.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.660
The owner wishes to welcome everyone.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.690
That girl...

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.180
Isn’t she the famous schoolgirl detective who's been appearing in the media recently?

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.140
Eh? That girl's also a detective?

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.180
You haven't heard of her?

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:45.660
Although she’s just a high school student, she’s apparently solved many cases, you know.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:50.440
Katsuragi... Yako.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.350
Why has she become a detective?

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:04.290
Ahh! It’s beginning to smell really good!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.530
Yeah… It’s good.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.230
The smell of mystery is thickening.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.190
Something is going to happen here soon.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.020
This is the main kitchen.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:25.660
Besides this one, there are two personal kitchens.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.920
Amazing!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.250
Owner!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:35.280
What a surprise... You must be the detectives and the inspectors.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:38.700
My deepest apologies for having you specially come here.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:42.350
I am the owner-chef of this establishment, Shirota.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.390
This kitchen is really spacious, isn't it?

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.390
And there are even personal kitchens?

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:52.690
Yes... Only a select few may prepare the main dishes here.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:56.560
Which is why two kitchens have been set aside for the Chief and myself.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:08:02.220
That over there is my right-hand man, the Chief Chef of this restaurant, Unno.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.560
But, enough about this, let us talk in my office.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.330
Now, about the threatening letter?

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:12.880
This is it.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:21.470
This restaurant should not exist.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.960
Before long, Heaven will unleash its judgment.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:28.180
I thought it was a small prank at first,

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.640
but they kept arriving, so I couldn’t simply ignore them anymore.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:36.680
If by some small chance something happened, our reputation would be tainted.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:40.480
For now, we will have personnel patrol here several times a day.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.180
Neuro, don't tell me...

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:50.340
Yes… the mystery has just finished cooking.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:56.590
Unno!

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:05.530
The victim is the Chief Chef of this restaurant, Unno Kouji.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:09.770
He was taken to the hospital immediately, but he appeared to have died instantly.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:15.030
The cause of death seems to have been bludgeoning from behind with a blunt weapon.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.160
A blunt weapon?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:22.420
It was carried out with amazing force, beyond what should be humanly possible.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.330
Amazing force?

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.300
Yeah.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:27.640
According to the testimony of the employees,

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:32.010
after Unno entered his personal kitchen, he never left once.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:36.150
No one entered his kitchen either.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:38.440
Time of the incident...

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:42.570
...would be after we saw the victim and during the time we were chatting in the office.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.410
About ten minutes in.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.570
That’s about all we know.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:53.420
The back entrance was open, so the culprit probably fled through there.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.730
Please, catch that criminal!

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:00.680
The thought of never being able to see Unno again...

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:03.320
I… I…

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:08.020
We too would've liked to meet him while he was alive,

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:12.060
if you had only introduced us at that time.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:13.350
What?

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:16.030
That’s what Sensei here said!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:16.960
Hey!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.760
Well, Sensei,

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.380
let’s go investigate!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.310
This! This is the dish!

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:34.610
The ultimate dish that they say will bring success!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:36.000
Oh?

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:38.260
Miss Detective is quite knowledgeable, it seems.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:39.670
That dish is-

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:43.470
Roasted salted duck breast with lemon endive sauce!

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:46.310
So good!

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.780
I wonder how good it really is!

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:50.010
Do you want to try it?

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:50.840
Really?

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.050
Is it <i>really</i> okay?

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:57.110
Yeah, it’d be a waste to throw it away.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.620
It-tadakimasu!

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.570
Delicious!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.730
But...

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.920
Somehow, this is not cooking.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.060
This dish insults the concept of eating.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.130
Unreasonable!

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:26.610
A m-mere h-high school kid...

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.030
insulting my cooking!

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.030
You ill-mannered brat!

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.110
I'm sorry, I didn't intend to-

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:34.470
You detectives are fired, get out of here!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:39.070
I’m going to prepare the ultimate dish now -- all of you, stay out!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.260
You got him mad.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:47.030
You’re obstructing police work! Get out!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.230
Sorry.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.080
You idiot. The mystery has withdrawn into its shell.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:59.530
But... I only expressed my true feelings.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:04.400
I, who came from the Demon World, will starve to death without mysteries to consume.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:08.990
But before that happens, I will consume your brain.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.620
Nose! Nose! Nose!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:15.860
I don't really understand it, but in the same way that you like mysteries,

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.110
I love to eat.

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:23.070
I eat when I’m happy, and also when I’m lonely.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:26.350
While I'm eating, I can forget about unpleasant things.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.620
I can feel happiness!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.940
But that dish...

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.990
Even though it was delicious, I didn't feel any happiness.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:38.620
In fact, it was somehow scary and chilling!

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:46.830
Even if you could gain success from that, would anyone truly be happy?

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:48.450
I see...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.010
The trick in all of this is becoming clear.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:53.010
After seeing your reaction,

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:57.480
I am now interested in the true nature of that dish.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:07.210
777 Tools of the Demon World

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.290
Evil Javelin!

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:14.680
This is not a javelin that cuts matter.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:19.090
Rather, it analyzes the composition of the matter it passes through.

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:22.120
I see…

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.950
This mystery is already on the tip of my tongue.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:30.970
Almost there...

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:34.390
Very soon, my greatest creation will be born.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.690
What business do you have?

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:40.630
Business?

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:43.090
Does that even need to be asked, Chef Shirota?

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.300
We've discovered the identity of the culprit.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.250
What?

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:50.170
Now, with that finger, point out the culprit!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:00.920
The culprit is…

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:03.180
You!

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:08.880
Hmph. Even rudeness has its limits.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.440
You all saw him alive and well earlier, didn't you?

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:15.840
After that point, I was with you the entire time.

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.830
All of you are my witnesses.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.080
Indeed.

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:22.190
And you, to obtain that alibi,

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:24.500
purposely called us here.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.820
Police and renowned detectives...

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.470
There are indeed no better witnesses than these.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:34.230
We did not actually see the victim alive.

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.150
We only saw him standing.

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:40.700
Amongst the boiled vegetables from the pot that were scattered on the floor,

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:44.070
there was one tomato that was entirely uncooked.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:48.500
The split in that tomato looked very unnatural.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:52.200
That was the core of the trick, wasn't it?

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.630
The order of events was this.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.990
You punctured a hole in the tomato, ran two ropes through it,

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.990
and then froze it solid.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:03.560
Then, you chose a time to call us over,

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:05.590
and killed the victim.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:10.320
Immediately after, you tied both ropes to the ventilation fans above the stove,

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.690
hung the corpse on the formed loop,

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.480
and placed the pot on the stove.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.610
You then turned on the fans, and thus completed the preparations.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.590
The vapor from the pot obscured the ropes,

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:24.490
making it look like he was still alive.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:29.820
After we conversed for a time, the tomato began to thaw,

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.190
and finally, no longer able to hold the corpse's weight,

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:33.240
split open.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.990
That...is Sensei’s theory.

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:44.670
We have them.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:48.630
These ropes that were tied to the ventilation fans.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.760
They're also stained with what appears to be tomato juice.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:58.180
But, can that constitute decisive evidence that I am the culprit?

00:15:58.230 --> 00:15:59.400
The culprit,

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:04.150
in order to conceal the real time of death,

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.160
probably killed the victim just prior to our arrival.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:15.230
In such a case, there should not have been enough time... to dispose of the weapon.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.460
This is the murder weapon, isn’t it?

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.780
Enough.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:30.280
Wow, already confessing to your crime?

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.280
So readily, too.

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:37.140
That guy... He got in the way of my cooking.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:42.590
He didn’t recognize the magnificence of these dishes.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.870
This stuff isn’t the ultimate dish!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.410
I even sent letters to the restaurant to warn you,

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:55.010
but in the end, you won't listen to me.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:17:01.280
I’m sorry, but there's no choice but to take my leave and go to the police.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.580
It can't be helped, then.

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:08.060
Especially since I trusted you...

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:11.120
I also think it's unfortunate!

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.330
I just can’t understand it!

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:18.530
I can’t understand the reason for that dish,

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:20.210
or the reason for killing people!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:25.420
There is no way you plebeians would understand the splendor of this.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:29.210
What exactly... is the secret in the dish?

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.330
Well…

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:34.600
That question will be easily answered if you analyze the soup over there.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.720
Along with countless first-class ingredients,

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:42.320
all sorts of narcotics like cocaine, heroin, and morphine are incorporated,

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:46.400
as well as steroids like testosterone and DHEA,

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:50.000
to achieve a precise, muscle-augmenting balance of constituents,

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:52.540
which is simmered for seven days and seven nights!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:58.130
There is no way urine or blood tests can detect it,

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.080
even though its components' effects are several times greater than normal,

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.960
and if taken directly into the blood, several times above that!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:06.930
This...

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:10.380
is the result of many years of research,

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.270
the ultimate dish,

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.520
Doping Consommé Soup!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.880
What the hell is this guy?

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:20.830
M-Monster...

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.360
What a worthless dish.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.610
What?

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.180
That’s what Sensei...

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.040
...said!

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:34.200
Using drugs to bring up your ratings is not cooking!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:37.300
Cooking is something that fills people up with love.

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:41.100
To put it simply, your cooking is below kitchen scraps.

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:44.430
Sensei would at least eat kitchen scraps, you see...

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:45.440
Who would?!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.100
How dare you even talk about cooking!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:54.800
My cooking is the ultimate cooking!

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:58.600
Neuro!

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.450
This is what you call ultimate?

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.330
What?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.500
Too disappointing.

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.020
For what you call your ultimate dish,

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:10.880
it is completely inedible.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.380
But do not worry --

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.820
I will still eat this mystery.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.290
Itadakimasu.

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:36.570
Ishigaki, ventilation!

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:37.480
Roger that!

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:38.440
Neuro!

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:42.980
Gochisousama.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:45.920
Neuro.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.650
Perhaps the side effects of the drugs kicked in?

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:53.250
Good thing it was just in time.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.600
But it still could not satisfy.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:07.470
Are the mysteries of the surface world merely of this caliber?

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:10.390
You will become more famous,

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:15.120
and in doing so, draw more and more delicious mysteries to me.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:20.400
This world is plagued by mysteries.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.670
The darkness within humans' hearts.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:25.040
And the existence of this guy.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:29.690
Have I been bewitched by this guy from the Demon World?

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:31.900
Why?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.720
Why did he choose me?

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.200
Neuro.

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:49.960
My father died.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.060
The police arbitrarily ruled it a suicide.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.560
All the doors and windows were locked,

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:59.750
and the house was completely inaccessible from outside, they said.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.240
It was impossible, though.

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:05.520
There's no way my father would have committed suicide!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:11.010
But, how was I going to expose the truth behind my father’s death?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.740
I didn’t really know.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:16.790
It was at a time like that... that I met him.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.630
Do you want to unravel the mystery?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.340
Who's that?

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:26.670
Is someone there?

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:36.960
You will be perfect as my disguise!

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:48.490
Next time: Community.

00:22:49.070 --> 00:22:52.680
This mystery is already on the tip of my tongue.

00:22:54.860 --> 00:22:59.900
Sales of this Chef Shirota joint development... have been discontinued.
